---
layout: page.njk
title: "Field Notes: velocity.report"
description: "Technical notes from building, measuring, and deploying velocity.report."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <header class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Field Notes</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Technical notes from building, measuring, and deploying velocity.report.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Design decisions, experiments, and the things a street teaches you that a
      specification does not. Written when there is something worth writing down,
      which is not the same as weekly.
    </p>
  </header>

  <ol class="note-index">
  {% for note in collections.notes %}
    <li class="note-index__item">
      <a href="{{ note.url }}" class="note-index__link">
        {% if note.data.date %}
        <p class="note-index__date">
          <time datetime="{{ note.data.date }}">{{ note.data.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
        </p>
        {% endif %}
        <h2 class="note-index__title">{{ note.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if note.data.description %}
        <p class="note-index__description">{{ note.data.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
      {% if note.data.topics %}
      <p class="note-index__topics">
        {% for topic in note.data.topics %}<span class="note-index__topic">{{ topic }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </p>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>
